      "description": "The legal power granted to law enforcement to conduct searches, inspections, and investigations. The meme references the police asking to inspect a niqab, which implies a legal boundary between state authority and individual rights.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_b82353f1"
